+## Five-role publishing extension
+
+Current Openings, role details, job-specific application IDs, and an authenticated HR job manager are implemented on the review branch. Five hiring needs have been confirmed by PK; see `CAREERS-JOB-MANAGEMENT.md` for exact source status and the create-only draft import. Full-Stack and AI/ML use original descriptions; QA, DevOps, and UI/UX copy remains newly drafted pending their original documents. The preview shows all five, but runtime publication requires complete HR-approved terms and authenticated publishing. This extends the earlier general-introduction-only scope without activating delivery or merging main.
